│ 100], 'studies': [{'study_index': 1, 'title': 'Which induction drug for cesarean section? A comparison of thiopental │
│ sodium, propofol, and midazolam', 'abstract': 'STUDY OBJECTIVE To determine maternal and neonatal effects of three   │
