│ {"study_index": 308, "title": "Can remifentanil replace nitrous oxide during anesthesia for ambulatory orthopedic    │
│ surgery with desflurane and fentanyl?", "abstract": "BACKGROUND The administration of nitrous oxide (N2O) may be     │
